  "scene":{"required":["start","end","template","variant"],"commonOptional":["id","section","title","callouts"],"title":["title","subtitle?","subtitleAt?","icon?"],"statement":["text","highlight?","highlightAt?","by?","label?"],"illustration":["text (optional for picture variant)","picture","highlight?","highlightAt?"],"media":["image","subtitle?","subtitleAt?","alt?","fit?: contain|cover"],"list":["title","items","takeaway?: {label,at,tone?}","intro?: {picture,label?} (spotlight only; visible until first item.at)"],"framework":["title","focus","items"],"comparison":["title","items"],"categories":["title","items"],"tool-selection":["title","focus","items"],"rule-exception":["title","focus","items (first is rule)"],"principle":["title","focus","items"],"sequence":["title","items"],"action":["action"],"story":["story"],"subtitleAt":"absolute seconds within scene; requires subtitle; subtitle remains hidden until this time"},
  "focus":{"fields":["label","icon","at?","brand?","tone?"],"tone":"same semantic tones as items; explicit tones override focus styling; rule/exception position never overrides tone"},
  "item":{"fields":["label","icon?","at?","tone?","details?","detailsAt?","rel?","brand?","goneAt?","hide?","picture?"],"iconsRequired":"all structural items and list cards/spotlight","details":"nonempty string[] only for comparison (0..6), categories (0..3), tool-selection (exactly 1); comparison/categories may omit details","detailsAt":"absolute seconds[], one per detail","hide":"[start,end][] absolute seconds","rel":["follows","example","also","so","because","except","contrast"],"tones":["default","accent","warning","muted"],"spotlight":"requires item.at on every item; optional item.picture replaces the active icon stage until next item.at; intro and item pictures, labels and local callouts stay above the caption band"},
